The monolithic diagnostic reached about 20 GiB RSS after eight minutes, so I stopped it before repeating the prior failure. I’m now introducing two derived reachability cuts—one for the four neighbor updates and one for the result loop plus odd tail. They summarize exact state transitions, not answers as operational rules, and let the final claim compose proven phases without retaining all earlier branch histories.
